  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_paper_cb97c9bdc8c89775192224e8f25d3202d9a9c9184105111263b8b236328b163707">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>paper, the fibre product, as an article of commerce; written or printed upon. Traded in many grades, colours, sizes and origins (white, brown, black, royal, cap, French, Genoese, Flemish, Venetian, etc.). For printed and painted sheets see printed paper and paynted paper; for the unit of measure see paper (measure).</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
